# A step that waits on the turns (docs/LEARNING.md "The lesson panel"; docs/BUILDING.md
# "Input scripts"): tutorial 2 at step 13, "Keep exploring", waits for five systems
# explored. It is going as it should however long it takes: after two minutes Next is
# still Next, not Skip. Then End Turn with the Colonies window open: its question comes up
# over the window and takes the click.
# 1024x768 only: at 800x600 the Colonies window covers End Turn (lesson-uncover.script plays
# a covered outline there).
options --tutorial=exploring-and-colonizing:13 --open=colonies --layout=1024x768 --size=1280x800
timeout 9000

wait-lesson exploring-and-colonizing
assert-step 13
wait 7300
assert-present item:Next in=lesson
assert-absent item:Skip in=lesson
assert-window colonies
click tag:button:end-turn
click item:Yes in="End Turn"
wait-turn 1
